<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto">法国多地10月17日爆发抗议活动，数万人因物价上涨和公共支出下降走上街头，同时表达对抗议学生的支持。警方与抗议者爆发冲突。<br/>在巴黎，有汽车和报刊亭被纵火，警方使用催泪瓦斯和水炮驱散暴力抗议者。但更多的和平抗议者高唱国歌、挥舞国旗进行游行。在里昂和马赛等地，有政府建筑物被纵火或破坏。<br/>截至下午，已有272人因暴力事件被捕。<br/>（<a href="https://www.reuters.com/world/students-trade-unions-yellow-vests-set-protest-across-france-2026-10-17/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">路透社</a>，<a href="https://apnews.com/article/france-school-protests-yellow-vest-44b9d3ba91ffad4029f975dced7e31cb" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">美联社</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/KvDeJ9RGyhgMy8DjKMNNhqE72tVUJoSzTicw1T-U1ZMj7g_O6h5huN830s3qU0roLKyn1xGnVw33n7Q9Ap7-imv49TwNDGiOVnqXWoQzpouwXzW90LijNKGoWy69ujlVz0UI4z_oc-pF0C_CGqrn-_Mx5KG0gfltvRl610YNAGrBU6SaE_f9HydW56F2iyPsD2lL_k3im__TlQiiXKftzcaRGRuBu3LrkmW0Iof7ZXtqpssBsLwHh5E9TtvGrWPoOM7pL0_7j7P8UCTYGABNlDB01MM-2TCgE0-LKQ3kBOI_pJiN3_xMU3oeUSpJ4Ir9NwARSZCedfbZfLo54mukhQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/gYhk9CIYERVRjnX6VCdYisYNT-YoezI1ygF4nxwzDPonbGfY5KGATPGbvIGJWzp6GGUgLDOf_oIZ6Mgth_FD-JJ_E2GXZV11DYKjV1-WtWFvdDvyRczJpzptyd1ujVtwC1Lxrlk1CAdUA7_dosVTfOSuKi1uPqQh4avM6AmlJhbFOFDVawiivPWTrk1V9S-ICGSRQK9o5Geb35l8sAkoH4ffwFOeK86BhLdp_LyGLaARGsp6OfWZ-fFSDqlIumVmN2LvYNqpAiMD5dmfK7SHwejr1mbFi0YDTvI9GQYki199lkgr4Sra8sBBHBnv8zcvtoJLb4-rsi7Ouf9k5ptelQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/oFYyBrF-tQoRucuxm_urYZSkkRXJjWdx9pJsNtoe_dgJbXapSjyLthUMeksfTOmErVCMhzVOq_XYijG3t19C5UL9rDVP0KKiAA2xJ8tOZ7qV3g5UeL4Omyh2IKuOWIiCsN_o2nWgHJa13T97vgaApCE-kWgEEhZ6k7zTKSO8N7MUVE1v7OzdMDD-8fk0CCuPPOu4oGhOHlAD7Nw0KGgdvK343iW0hGGzOzo98SeSEh4jqGoZyoUTIx6zPmGmP7ou8_0ZV5xeFBSKc-c1vhy-aWn7RH-z2T2rA-hEceZw8nBGZtHhSnSqIratgBKZxSmzHvW