<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto">俄罗斯堪察加半岛北京时间10月16日11:35:31发生6.9级地震，震源深度135千米。<br/>日本气象厅一度将地震规模误报至9.9级，并针对北海道至东海地方几乎全域发布最大震度7的<a href="https://eew-history.dmdata.ne.jp/20261016123810" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">紧急地震速报</a>。约8分48秒后气象厅撤销了紧急地震速报，这也是紧急地震速报系统自2008年投入运行以来，首次撤销紧急地震速报“警报”的发布。<br/>此次地震日本实际录得最大震度1，在北海道函馆市。NHK北海道各放送局均未感受到明显摇晃。<br/>此次误报导致东海道新干线一度停运。JR东日本表示，东北新干线和在来线的运行未受此次紧急地震速报影响。<br/>日本气象厅在当地时间14时召开的记者会上表示，正在调查此次误报的详情，并否认系统遭受网络攻击。<br/>（<a href="https://earthquake.usgs.gov/earthquakes/eventpage/us6000u2mq/executive" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">美国地质调查局</a>，NHK <a href="https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261016de60368" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">1</a>，<a href="https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261016de60369" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">2</a>，<a href="https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261016de60374" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">3</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/SRJgr5l-zozYsDo2x9NJJrlwbTulvnIm1NJ4VR1j_M1yWO6Jb4kmawOQqw6KOM63tmYLLTptuUtQ3n8meVaOlsp_KVJjvyFtsUM9bRQyYdBpDFIeUd_r247HS7OBqOd0MVYQD9afD2AC9xEvZrSzUYnCh-riRwQmjtmq192jgdKNXqrFfldwVwuPbS9gkiiJg9ZjlEtdLjb7YLYF-brfImmLBa0wIoo7w7cpcZSEHkj0-SwGiDzTKBd8l_tHPJbCkCDxyJ03F7zrogemqSNAjizNpXGaW3epFq4LP5NiDf6b2D3Ra6oC-B3X50-Z5Rffo8mSJZC7z31IlOGPEP3jgw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/NHXlY99WnV2Tmo0Mp61yOjJ_3WnXjH_Sz5SJW6e6co7QaQM2N2jqMUlDeuZv8LUDhPciv2WWzyvPiQZ0vKBm6x8B5Ujwv3t0koWRO8UesnPVSFWVbBhnXabArO3q-hstGgOzxTWCJ83RvGNU9EFdsqxfhJXafDqrZ5iaNl9lA8D2oHExYYE-DsBN2Usrfr6LwyZXqOQX0Cwy1no88X8dWj4qEYfV5fANZBsWgl9Jdikm-pcEHNZ8bLLFGFo3